INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('beyond-transactions-how-ai-point-of-sale-enhances-the-restaurant-pos-hardware-and-point-of-purchase', '''Revolutionizing the Restaurant Experience with AI Point of Sale''', 'Restaurant point of sale (POS) systems have come a long way from being simple cash registers. Today, the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) is revolutionizing POS hardware and transforming the point of purchase...', '[{"type":"p","text":"Restaurant point of sale (POS) systems have come a long way from being simple cash registers. Today, the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) is revolutionizing POS hardware and transforming the point of purchase experience for both restaurant owners and their customers. Let''s delve into how AI Point-of-Sale is changing the game."},{"type":"h2","text":"Elevating the Customer Journey"},{"type":"ul","items":["Personalized Recommendations: AI POS systems can analyze customer order history and preferences to suggest tailored menu items or complementary pairings. This enhances the dining experience by making customers feel valued and understood."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Streamlined Ordering : Imagine a POS system that can accurately interpret voice commands or recognize gestures, making ordering faster and more intuitive. AI-powered self-ordering kiosks or tableside tablets empower customers to browse menus, customize their orders, and even pay their bills independently."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Frictionless Payments : AI POS systems are enabling seamless transactions through facial recognition or mobile payment apps. This not only speeds up the checkout process but also enhances security by reducing the need for physical cards."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Empowering Restaurant Owners and Staff"},{"type":"ul","items":["Data-Driven Insights: AI POS systems are powerful data collection tools. They can analyze sales trends, peak hours, popular menu items, and customer demographics. This information empowers restaurant owners to make informed decisions about inventory management, menu optimization, and staffing schedules."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Inventory Management Made Easy: No more manual stocktaking! AI POS systems can automatically track inventory levels, alert you to low-stock situations, and even generate purchase orders. This streamlines operations and reduces food waste."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Staff Efficiency Boost: AI POS systems can handle routine tasks like order processing and payment collection, freeing up your staff to focus on providing excellent customer service. This translates to happier customers and a more efficient team."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Predictive Analytics: AI-powered POS systems can forecast future demand based on historical data and external factors like weather or local events. This enables restaurants to prepare for busy periods and ensure adequate staffing and inventory."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Real-World Examples"},{"type":"p","text":"The potential applications of AI POS are vast. Here are a few examples of how it''s already being used:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Smart Menu Boards: These digital displays can dynamically adjust menu items based on real-time inventory, popularity, or time of day."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Virtual Waitstaff: In some establishments, AI-powered chatbots or robots are assisting customers with ordering, recommendations, and even delivering food to tables."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Loyalty Programs: AI POS systems can track customer spending and offer personalized rewards, fostering repeat business."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Choosing the Right AI POS System"},{"type":"p","text":"If you''re considering implementing an AI POS system for your restaurant, keep these factors in mind:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Your Restaurant''s Needs: What are your pain points? What areas could you streamline or improve with AI?"]},{"type":"ul","items":["Ease of Use: Look for a system with an intuitive interface that your staff can easily learn and use."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Integration Capabilities: Does the AI POS system integrate with your existing software (e.g., accounting, inventory management)?"]},{"type":"ul","items":["Scalability: Will the system grow with your business?"]},{"type":"ul","items":["Customer Support: Ensure the vendor offers reliable support and training."]},{"type":"h2","text":"The Future of AI in Restaurants"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is poised to continue transforming the restaurant industry. We can anticipate even more sophisticated features, like hyper-personalized menus, AI-generated recipes, and AI-powered kitchen robots that optimize food preparation. The possibilities are truly exciting."},{"type":"h2","text":"In Conclusion"},{"type":"p","text":"AI point of sale systems is not just about processing transactions. They''re about enhancing the entire dining experience, empowering restaurant owners with valuable data, and streamlining operations. By embracing AI POS technology, restaurants can stay ahead of the curve and thrive in the digital age."},{"type":"h2","text":"Ready to See the Future of Restaurant POS?"},{"type":"p","text":"Don''t get left behind. Schedule a personalized demo today to discover how AI POS can revolutionize your restaurant''s operations and enhance the dining experience for your customers."}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d9b20_4f3231989d994c9f94598700bb612247~mv2.png', 'Point of Sale', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-04-10', 'published');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('boosting-bar-profits-proven-strategies-with-bar-software-point-of-sale-july-14', 'Revolutionize Your Bar Profits with Bar Software Point-of-Sale', 'As a bar owner or manager, you know that maximizing profits is essential to keeping the drinks flowing and the good times rolling. In today''s competitive landscape, utilizing technology can be a game-changer. That''s...', '[{"type":"p","text":"As a bar owner or manager, you know that maximizing profits is essential to keeping the drinks flowing and the good times rolling. In today''s competitive landscape, utilizing technology can be a game-changer. That''s where bar software point-of-sale (POS) systems come in. These powerful tools go far beyond processing transactions - they can revolutionize how you run your bar and significantly boost your bottom line. Let''s dive into how you can leverage POS software to your advantage."},{"type":"h2","text":"Understanding the Power of Bar Point-of-Sale Software"},{"type":"p","text":"A bar point-of-sale system is a centralized hub for managing various aspects of your business. It combines hardware (like touchscreens, card readers, and receipt printers) with sophisticated software designed specifically for the bar industry. This software streamlines tasks, provides valuable insights, and empowers you to make informed decisions."},{"type":"h2","text":"Key Features to Elevate Your Bar"},{"type":"p","text":"Here are some essential features to look for in a bar point-of-sale system that can directly impact your profitability:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Inventory Management : Track your stock levels in real-time, automate ordering, and receive alerts for low inventory. This prevents running out of popular items and ensures optimal stock levels."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Sales Analytics: Gain a clear picture of your best-selling drinks, peak hours, and busiest days. This data helps you tailor your offerings, promotions, and staffing to maximize sales."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Menu Customization: Easily update your menu with new drinks, happy hour specials, or seasonal offerings. Keep your menu fresh and exciting for customers."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Staff Management: Manage employee schedules, track hours worked, and calculate tips efficiently. Simplify payroll and ensure smooth operations."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Customer Loyalty Programs: Reward your regulars with points, discounts, or exclusive offers. Build customer loyalty and encourage repeat business."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Table Management: Visualize your bar''s layout, assign tables to servers, and track table status (open, occupied, or reserved). This optimizes table turnover and enhances customer experience."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Pour Cost Tracking: Calculate the cost of each drink you pour and compare it to your selling price. Identify high-cost items and adjust pricing or recipes accordingly."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Proven Strategies to Boost Bar Profits"},{"type":"p","text":"1. Data-Driven Decision Making: Utilize the sales data from your point-of-sale system to make informed decisions. Identify trends, understand customer preferences, and adapt your offerings based on real-time insights."},{"type":"p","text":"2. Targeted Promotions: Create targeted promotions based on your sales data. Offer discounts on slow-moving items or bundle deals to increase sales volume."},{"type":"p","text":"3. Streamlined Operations: Automate tasks like inventory ordering, table management, and tip calculation. This frees up your staff to focus on providing excellent customer service."},{"type":"p","text":"4. Enhanced Customer Experience: Offer a smooth and efficient ordering process, personalized service, and loyalty programs to make your customers feel valued and appreciated."},{"type":"p","text":"5. Cost Control: Track your pour costs, identify areas for optimization, and minimize waste. Small adjustments can significantly impact your profit margins."},{"type":"p","text":"6. Happy Hour Optimization: Use your point-of-sale system to analyze the effectiveness of your happy hour specials. Experiment with different offerings and timings to find what works best for your bar."},{"type":"p","text":"7. Menu Engineering: Price your drinks strategically based on their cost and perceived value. Consider offering different sizes or premium options to cater to various budgets."},{"type":"p","text":"8. Staff Training: Ensure your staff is well-trained on how to use the point-of-sale system efficiently. This will speed up service, reduce errors, and improve overall customer satisfaction."},{"type":"h2","text":"Choosing the Right Point-of-Sale System for Your Bar"},{"type":"p","text":"Selecting the right point-of-sale system is crucial for maximizing its benefits. Consider the following factors:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Bar-Specific Features: Look for a system tailored to the unique needs of bars and restaurants."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Ease of Use: The system should be intuitive and easy for your staff to learn and use."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Scalability: Choose a system that can grow with your business."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Customer Support: Reliable customer support is essential in case of technical issues or questions."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Cost: Compare the upfront costs and ongoing fees of different systems to find one that fits your budget."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Ready to Take Your Bar to the Next Level?"},{"type":"p","text":"Schedule a free consultation and personalized product demo today to see how the right point-of-sale system can transform your bar''s profitability. Our team of experts is here to help you find the perfect solution for your unique needs."}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/7e7af0_fd8c8965697549c4a43fc46316e9cd69~mv2.jpg', 'Analytics & Reporting', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-04-08', 'published');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('boosting-sales-with-point-of-purchase-10-effective-tactics', 'Boosting Sales with Point of Purchase: 10 Effective Tactics', 'Tired of clunky, outdated point of sale systems that slow down your service and frustrate your staff? It''s time to embrace a new era of restaurant management with our cutting-edge handheld point of purchase solution....', '[{"type":"p","text":"Tired of clunky, outdated point of sale systems that slow down your service and frustrate your staff? It''s time to embrace a new era of restaurant management with our cutting-edge handheld point of purchase solution. Here''s how this compact powerhouse can supercharge your sales and streamline your operations:"},{"type":"h2","text":"1\\. Unleash Next-Level Efficiency"},{"type":"p","text":"Our handheld point of sale system packs the full capabilities of a traditional system into a palm-sized device. Say goodbye to bulky terminals and hello to seamless order-taking, streamlined payments (including EMV and contactless), and uninterrupted operation - even offline."},{"type":"h2","text":"2\\. Slash Costs, Boost Features"},{"type":"p","text":"Ditch the expensive, labor-intensive point of sale systems of the past. Our affordable solution doesn''t compromise on features. It''s designed for effortless integration with your existing setup, saving you both time and money."},{"type":"h2","text":"3\\. Real-Time MenuSync™: Your Menu, Always Up-to-Date"},{"type":"p","text":"Keep your menu in perfect sync across your dashboard and point of sale system. Real-Time MenuSync™ ensures instant updates, so your staff and customers always have the latest information. This automation saves valuable time and reduces errors."},{"type":"h2","text":"4\\. Empower Your Guests with Self-Ordering"},{"type":"p","text":"Elevate the dining experience by putting the power in your guests'' hands. Our handheld point of sale system allows customers to browse, customize, and place their orders directly from their own devices. This innovative approach reduces wait times, increases order accuracy, and enhances customer satisfaction."},{"type":"h2","text":"5\\. Freedom of Payment Options"},{"type":"p","text":"Cater to every guest''s preference with a wide range of payment options. Our system supports tap, swipe, and dip payments, as well as electronic and paper receipts, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free checkout process."},{"type":"h2","text":"6\\. Boost Sales with Upselling and Cross-Selling"},{"type":"p","text":"Drive higher average order values by strategically suggesting complementary items or upgrades during the ordering process. Our handheld point of sale system makes it easy to implement upselling and cross-selling techniques, boosting your bottom line."},{"type":"h2","text":"7\\. Streamline Inventory Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain real-time visibility into your inventory levels with our intuitive dashboard. Track stock, identify low-stock items, and optimize your purchasing decisions to minimize waste and maximize profits."},{"type":"h2","text":"8\\. Data-Driven Insights for Smarter Decisions"},{"type":"p","text":"Access detailed sales reports, customer data, and performance analytics at your fingertips. Use these insights to identify trends, optimize your menu, and make informed business decisions that drive growth."},{"type":"h2","text":"9\\. Enhance Staff Productivity and Satisfaction"},{"type":"p","text":"Empower your staff with eatOS user-friendly point of sale system that''s intuitive and efficient to use. Reduce training time, streamline workflows, and free up your team to focus on delivering exceptional customer service."},{"type":"h2","text":"10\\. Partner for Success"},{"type":"p","text":"We''re not just a technology provider; we''re your partner in success. Our dedicated support team is always available to assist you with any questions or issues, ensuring that you get the most out of your handheld point of sale system."},{"type":"h2","text":"Ready to Revolutionize Your Restaurant?"},{"type":"p","text":"Experience the future of restaurant management with our handheld point of sale system. Boost sales, streamline operations, and delight your customers with a seamless dining experience."},{"type":"p","text":"Reach out today to schedule a personalized consultation and a free product demo. Let us show you how our solution can transform your restaurant and elevate your bottom line."}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d9b20_eef427bf02fa4e64904ee1e183452ac0~mv2.jpg', 'Point of Sale', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-04-05', 'published');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('choosing-the-right-kitchen-display-system-for-your-quick-service-restaurant-a-comprehensive-guide', 'Choosing the Right KDS for Quick Service - eatOS', 'The Quick Service Restaurant environment, efficiency, and accuracy are paramount to success in this fast-paced industry. Long wait lines, kitchen chaos, and order errors can easily erode customer loyalty and...', '[{"type":"p","text":"The Quick Service Restaurant environment, efficiency, and accuracy are paramount to success in this fast-paced industry. Long wait lines, kitchen chaos, and order errors can easily erode customer loyalty and satisfaction. An intelligently selected Kitchen Display System (KDS) has the potential to revolutionize your business by optimizing processes, enhancing order precision, and eventually increasing profits."},{"type":"p","text":"This thorough guide examines the important factors to take into account when choosing the best Kitchen Display System for your QSR. Knowing the advantages of a KDS, figuring out what features are necessary, and looking into extra features will help you make an informed choice that will empower your kitchen staff and improve the experience for customers."},{"type":"h2","text":"The Power of a Kitchen Display System for Your Quick Service Restaurant"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional paper-based order management systems in QSRs can be the reason for delays, errors, and misplaced errors. Misplaced orders, misread tickets, and frantic scrambling during peak hours can significantly impact the service quality of your restaurant."},{"type":"p","text":"By electronically displaying orders on a special screen in the kitchen, a KDS provides a digital solution. There are numerous benefits of using real-time visibility in your kitchen. Some are as follows:"},{"type":"h2","text":"Enhanced Order Accuracy"},{"type":"p","text":"Clear digital displays eliminate the possibility of misinterpreting handwritten tickets, minimizing errors and ensuring correct order fulfillment."},{"type":"h2","text":"Improved Speed of Service"},{"type":"p","text":"Orders are received and displayed instantaneously, allowing kitchen staff to prioritize and expedite preparation, leading to faster service for customers."},{"type":"h2","text":"Streamlined Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Kitchen staff can readily view order details, including modifications and special requests, ensuring everyone is on the same page."},{"type":"h2","text":"Reduced Order Confusion"},{"type":"p","text":"KDS systems often display estimated preparation times, facilitating task management and minimizing kitchen chaos during peak periods."},{"type":"h2","text":"Data-Driven Insights"},{"type":"p","text":"Many Kitchen Display System solutions provide valuable data on order times, popular menu items, and kitchen performance metrics. This information allows you to optimize menus, staffing levels, and overall operations for maximum efficiency."},{"type":"h2","text":"Choosing the Perfect KDS Fit for Your QSR"},{"type":"p","text":"It is important to choose the right KDS for your kitchen. Following are a few tips to follow while choosing the right KDS."},{"type":"h2","text":"User-Friendliness"},{"type":"p","text":"An interface that is easy to use is essential. To cut down on training time and increase productivity, your kitchen staff should find your KDS intuitive and simple to use."},{"type":"h2","text":"Scalability"},{"type":"p","text":"Think about your goals for future expansion. Will the larger menu, higher order volume, and possible expansion to more locations be supported by your selected KDS?"},{"type":"h2","text":"Integration of Point of Sale Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Order fulfillment is streamlined and errors are decreased when manual data entry is removed through seamless integration with your Point-of-Sale (POS) system."},{"type":"h2","text":"Customization Options"},{"type":"p","text":"It''s critical to have the capacity to classify items, create custom order displays, and set up alerts for particular circumstances. You can customize the system to meet your specific operational and workflow requirements with a flexible KDS."},{"type":"h2","text":"Budgetary considerations"},{"type":"p","text":"The cost of KDS systems varies. Establish your spending limit and rank the features that will add the most value to your quick service restaurant business. A lot of suppliers provide complimentary trials so you can try the system out before making a purchase."},{"type":"h2","text":"Technical Assistance"},{"type":"p","text":"To guarantee seamless operation and prompt resolution of any possible technical issues with your KDS, dependable ongoing technical support is essential."},{"type":"h2","text":"Top KDS Features to Enhance Your Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Although fundamental features are necessary, eatOS KDS systems provide extra features that can enhance your QSR operations even more:"},{"type":"h2","text":"Inventory management"},{"type":"p","text":"You can avoid stockouts and service interruptions by using real-time inventory tracking to detect low stock levels."},{"type":"h2","text":"Menu Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Streamline menu changes and guarantee consistency across all touchpoints by simply updating menu items and prices on the KDS."},{"type":"h2","text":"Kitchen Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"With the ability to communicate in both directions, kitchen employees can provide the front-of-house team with up-to-date information on the status of orders in real-time, including any special requests or possible delays."},{"type":"h2","text":"Invest in Efficiency: The Road to QSR Success"},{"type":"p","text":"A well-chosen KDS has the potential to revolutionize your QSR. Through increased order accuracy, streamlined processes, and improved communication, a KDS gives your kitchen employees more power and improves the dining experience for customers. You can choose the best KDS to advance your QSR toward operational excellence and long-term success by keeping these factors in mind."},{"type":"p","text":"Get eatOS for free right now! With its intuitive interface, seamless Point-of-Sale System integration, and cutting-edge features, our cloud-based KDS is built to maximize every facet of your kitchen operations. Make an appointment for a free demo on our website to discover how we can help your Quick Service Restaurants realize its greatest potential!"}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d9b20_0bc3c8310236459ca9166e9e75dba645~mv2.jpg', 'Kitchen Operations', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-04-03', 'published');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('cost-effective-point-of-sale-hardware-solutions-for-restaurants', 'Cost-Effective POS Hardware Solutions for Restaurants - eatOS', 'Hey there, fellow foodies and restaurant aficionados! Running a restaurant is a labor of love, the energy, the delicious aromas, the satisfied smiles of your guests. It''s a truly rewarding experience. However, the...', '[{"type":"p","text":"Hey there, fellow foodies and restaurant aficionados! Running a restaurant is a labor of love, the energy, the delicious aromas, the satisfied smiles of your guests. It''s a truly rewarding experience. However, the financial side of things can sometimes be a bit daunting, with expenses popping up like mushrooms after a spring rain."},{"type":"p","text":"One significant investment that often looms large is the point of sale hardware for restaurants. But hold your horses! Before you start sweating bullets over the potential cost, remember this: You don''t need to sacrifice your first-born to acquire a fantastic point of sale system that can revolutionize your business. Let''s delve into a treasure trove of budget-friendly options and smart strategies that will give your restaurant a technological edge without emptying your wallet."},{"type":"h2","text":"Why Your Restaurant Needs eatOS Point of Sale System (Yes, Even on a Shoestring Budget)"},{"type":"p","text":"Sure, you could stick with the old-school cash register and pen-and-paper method, but let''s be honest, it''s not the most efficient way to run a modern restaurant. A point of sale system is so much more than a glorified calculator, it''s the nerve center of your entire operation. Here''s why you need one, even if you''re watching your pennies:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Guest Experience Extraordinaire: Impress your customers with lightning-fast service, accurate orders, and a seamless payment process. A modern point of sale system can make a world of difference in creating a positive dining experience, encouraging repeat visits, and generating glowing online reviews."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Inventory Management , Simplified: Say goodbye to those dreaded late-night inventory checks. A point of sale system can automatically track your stock levels, sending you alerts when it''s time to reorder. This not only saves you time but also helps prevent food waste and ensures you never run out of your customers'' favorite dishes."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Staff Management Made Effortless: Streamline your employee management tasks with features like scheduling, time tracking, and tip calculations. This frees up your valuable time so you can focus on other aspects of your business, like menu development or marketing."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Data-Driven Decision Making: Knowledge is power, and a point of sale system gives you a wealth of it. Access detailed reports on sales trends, peak hours, and popular menu items. Use this data to make informed decisions that can boost your profitability, optimize your operations, and enhance the overall customer experience."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Finding Your Budget-Friendly Point of Sale Solution"},{"type":"p","text":"Now that we''ve established the undeniable importance of a point of sale system, let''s explore some strategies and features to keep in mind when searching for the perfect budget-friendly option:"},{"type":"ul","items":["Prioritize User-Friendliness: The last thing you want is a complex system that leaves your staff scratching their heads. Opt for a point of sale system with an intuitive interface that''s easy to learn and use, even for those who aren''t tech-savvy."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Essential Functions First: Start with the basics, order taking, payment processing, and basic reporting. You can always upgrade to a more comprehensive system with additional features as your business grows and your budget allows."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Scalability for Future Growth: Choose a system that can evolve alongside your restaurant. Ensure it allows for the addition of more terminals, advanced features, and integrations with other software, such as accounting or online ordering platforms."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Cloud-Based vs. On-Premise: Consider the pros and cons of both options. Cloud-based systems are generally more affordable upfront and offer automatic updates and remote access, while on-premise systems may provide greater control and customization."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Customer Support is Key: Technical issues can arise at the most inconvenient times. Look for a provider that offers reliable customer support, ideally with 24/7 availability, to minimize downtime and keep your operations running smoothly."]},{"type":"h2","text":"Budget-Savvy Strategies"},{"type":"ul","items":["Software Subscriptions: Many point of sale providers offer cost-effective monthly subscription plans that include software updates, support, and access to new features. This can be a more affordable alternative to purchasing a system outright."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Hardware Bundles: Explore bundled deals that combine software and hardware at a discounted price. Make sure to compare different bundles and assess their suitability for your specific needs."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Payment Processing Options : Don''t just settle for the first payment processor you come across. Compare rates and fees from different providers to ensure you''re getting the best deal possible."]},{"type":"ul","items":["Free Trials and Demos : Before you commit to a particular system, take advantage of free trials or demos offered by providers. This gives you a chance to test-drive the software and hardware, ensuring it''s a good fit for your restaurant''s workflow."]},{"type":"h2","text":"The Right Point of Sale System: Your Restaurant''s Secret Weapon"},{"type":"p","text":"With a bit of research and careful consideration, you can find an affordable point of sale system that perfectly aligns with your budget and your restaurant''s unique needs. The right system will become your most valuable tool, streamlining your operations, enhancing the customer experience, and ultimately boosting your bottom line. So, embrace the power of technology and watch your restaurant thrive!"},{"type":"p","text":"Ready to unlock the full potential of your restaurant? Don''t wait any longer. Explore eatOS affordable point of sale systems today and discover how they can transform your business for the better!"}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d9b20_edab258438ed45bc8732bc110b21ca98~mv2.jpg', 'Point of Sale', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-04-02', 'published');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover_image, category, author_name, published_at, status) VALUES ('culinary-innovations-highlights-from-the-national-restaurant-show', 'Culinary Innovations: Highlights from the National Restaurant Show', 'Will people''s preference for spicy and sweet food fade? Is there a decrease in plant-based meat?', '[{"type":"p","text":"Will people''s preference for spicy and sweet food fade? Is there a decrease in plant-based meat?"},{"type":"h2","text":"A Comprehensive Walkthrough"},{"type":"p","text":"Answers to these and a preview of future developments can be found at this year''s annual National Restaurant Show. To bring you the major menu trends that we found, we visited a lot of exhibit aisles, went to a lot of training sessions, and tasted a lot of food both inside and outside of McCormick Place."},{"type":"p","text":"Energy drinks, fruity sodas, sparkling wines without alcohol, boba, coffee, tea, and a plethora of other liquid refreshments were available at the fair. But as we were searching for fresh drink flavors, cardamom began to rise."},{"type":"h2","text":"Exploring The Emerging Flavours"},{"type":"p","text":"A mandarin cardamom soft drink with a hint of turmeric was available from Tractor, a boutique beverage brand making inroads into the fast-casual market. At the California Milk Advisory Board pavilion, samples of cardamom mango lassi were distributed. The fragrant spice gives these drinks a nice, exotic twist, but it''s also commonly used in baking and Indian food."},{"type":"h2","text":"Fermentation And Umami Explosions"},{"type":"p","text":"Food is preserved by fermentation, which also enhances umami, the savory fifth taste that is difficult to pinpoint. Planit POD, a novel fermentation system that Waring unveiled at its booth, is intended to ferment and pasteurize plant-based proteins like tempeh and koji in a mere 24 hours."},{"type":"p","text":"Chef Jeremy Umansky used mold fermentation to create a crispy, intensely flavorful crust on the proteins and to explode with flavor in his chickpea tempeh and Middle Eastern-spiced meat mixture."},{"type":"h2","text":"Innovative Substitutes of Caviare"},{"type":"p","text":"Although caviare has long been considered a delicacy for fine dining establishments, most operators find it to be neither sustainable nor cost-effective. There are a few products this year that, at least in terms of texture and presentation, can be substituted for caviar. Chile Pepper Flavor is one of the FABI award winners for food and beverage innovation. The caviar-sized pearls are naturally filled with a liquid mixture of chili and red bell peppers. When eaten, they release a delectable burst of flavor and make an eye-catching garnish."},{"type":"p","text":"Little pearls known as caviar oil, which are made from Arbequina olive oil, have a more neutral flavor and the same effect. We also sampled finger lime caviar, which is imported from Australia by Mad Honey. The fruit contains pearls, which can be purchased frozen. They can also be melted in the tongue to produce the \"caviar effect\" and a striking garnish of pastel hues."},{"type":"p","text":"Seaweed flakes can be used instead if you''d rather have a saltier, more caviar-like flavor. Ocean''s Balance makes butter that resembles real caviar in both taste and appearance by combining seaweed flakes with lemon peel."},{"type":"h2","text":"Unique Version of Pizza Crusts"},{"type":"p","text":"Seaweed butter works well as a spread on bread. Pine nuts are a type of flatbread from Rome that''s becoming popular as a pizza crust of the future. The one we sampled was hand-rolled, gluten-free, and maintained its crispy texture even when paired with cheese and veggies. It''s better for you and easier to digest than regular pizza dough, which is helpful when you spend hours stuffing your face with samples from dozens of exhibitors."},{"type":"h2","text":"Beverages Infused with THC"},{"type":"p","text":"Many states allow the sale and service of THC-containing drinks, so exhibitors were open to moving from CBD vendors to those offering a stronger cannabis derivative. We tried a thimbleful of CannaSpritz from Flora Hemp Spirits. Even though it only has 3 milligrams of THC, we felt a little high. The drink''s best feature is that it had a nice flavor profile: it was dry, bubbly, and slightly sweet with hints of floral notes."},{"type":"h2","text":"Canna Spritz"},{"type":"p","text":"The team at RB enjoyed Avocados from Mexico''s Guacamole Bar, but we were particularly fond of the Guac Extensions made by Modern Market''s chef Nate Weir, who conducted the demonstrations on Monday. To add some bitterness, he first mashed fresh avocado with tomatillo salsa as a base and then added hops, which is the same ingredient in beer. This guacamole gave a fish taco a complex flavor boost."},{"type":"h2","text":"A Twist to Guacamole"},{"type":"p","text":"Weir combined tamarind with avocado in the second demonstration to add tropical flavors that were both sweet and sour. They served it with glazed grilled shrimp and added some roasted mushrooms, tomatillo salsa, and a hint of spicy crunch. They intend to dispel the myth that guacamole is only appropriate for Mexican or Latin American cooking. For us, it was effective."},{"type":"h2","text":"The Zero-Waste Spirits"},{"type":"p","text":"The California dairy industry is pushing a new spirit called Wheyward Wheyskey, which is made from recycled whey leftover from making cheese. The beverage is served in a drink akin to an espresso martini and is topped with a scoop of double rainbow vanilla ice cream. The zero-waste trend served as the inspiration for this product. tasted rich and delicious, like a slightly alcoholic affogato."},{"type":"p","text":"This was all about the menu trends we found this year at the National Restaurant Show. Which trend would you like to try for yourself? The show was entertaining for the foodies and it surely created some future food trends."},{"type":"p","text":"Disclaimer: This article is informative and not for promotional purposes. Moreover, the content belongs to the owner and there are no affiliations or marketing motives behind it."}]', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/0d9b20_b9062301343043cc85bdcbdf4331a74a~mv2.jpg', 'Kitchen Operations', 'eatOS Staff', '2024-03-29', 'published');
